{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-08-15 11:00:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL MOBILITY NAMES MARK RECHTIN AS EXECUTIVE EDITOR', 'text': 'RECHTIN WILL LEAD EDITORIAL EFFORTS IN TRANSFORMING S&P GLOBAL MOBILITY INSIGHTS SOUTHFIELD, MICH. , AUG. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P GLOBAL MOBILITY, A DIVISION OF S&P GLOBAL (NYSE: SPGI) AND A WORLD LEADER IN DATA, TECHNOLOGY, AND EXPERTISE, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS HIRED AWARD-WINNING JOURNALIST, ANALYST, AND EDITOR MARK RECHTIN FOR THE NEWLY CREATED ROLE OF EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR AND EXECUTIVE EDITOR.'}